<title>AUSTRIA: TENNIS-WOMEN'S STYRIA OPEN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WOMEN'S STYRIA OPEN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MARIA LANKOWITZ, Austria 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second round results at the $107,000 women's Styria Open tennis tournament on Thursday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>3-Judith Wiesner (Austria) beat Amelie Cocheteux (France) 6-3 6-0</p>
<p>Maria Sanchez-Lorenzo (Spain) beat Virginia Ruano-Pascual (Spain) 7-6 (8-6) 3-6 6-2</p>
<p>6-Henrieta Nagyova (Slovakia) beat Ines Gorrochategui (Argentina) 7-5 6-4</p>
<p>4-Patty Schnyder (Switzerland) beat Magdalena Grzybowska (Poland) 6-1 2-0, Grzybowska retired injured</p>
<p>1-Barbara Paulus (Austria) beat Laura Garrone (Italy)  6-3 6-4.</p>
</text>
